# Working on this project

Read the code that the change touches, then check the brand guidelines and current docs before editing. Do not guess a color, font, logo, or page that is not in the repo or the guidelines.

Keep the change as small as the task. Do not add a component, hook, or dependency for markup that fits in the file you are already editing.

Do not run shell commands to print values you can read from the file.
